Package: labtools
Title: Lab Data Analysis Tools with Command Line Apps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("drclocli", email = "torreschloe64@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools to analyse data produced in the lab. Each tool is an R
    function that writes its results to an output folder and returns the
    created file paths, plus a command line app built with 'Rapp'. Includes
    radar charts of mediators (cytokines, oxylipins) as fold change vs a
    reference condition.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0),
    grDevices,
    grid,
    jsonlite,
    Rapp (>= 0.4.0),
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    svglite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
